_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a Mitzvah Quote<\/a><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h3>Gold Mitzvah MC + DJ Package<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Best for events up to 500 guests.<\/strong> The Gold Package adds a dedicated Master of Ceremonies and motivational dancer. As a result, it is a great fit for families who want more interaction, games, introductions, and crowd engagement.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Master of Ceremonies to host games, lead dances, and handle introductions<\/li>\n<li>One VJ \/ DJ to play music and video clips<\/li>\n<li>One motivational dancer<\/li>\n<li>Up to four hours of continuous music<\/li>\n<li>Complimentary online planning forms so our staff can understand your vision<\/li>\n<li>Online music request tools for must-play, play-if-possible, and do-not-play songs<\/li>\n<li>Game idea sheet so you can choose favorite games for your mitzvah celebration<\/li>\n<li>Two-speaker professional enhanced sound system<\/li>\n<li>Mini-club light show and fog to enhance the party atmosphere<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a Mitzvah Quote<\/a><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h3>Gold Plus Mitzvah Entertainment Package<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Best for events up to 750 guests.<\/strong> The Gold Plus Package is built for larger mitzvah celebrations that need more sound coverage and a stronger party setup. In addition, it includes an enhanced speaker system with a subwoofer.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Master of Ceremonies to host games, lead dances, and handle introductions<\/li>\n<li>One VJ \/ DJ to play music and video clips<\/li>\n<li>One motivational dancer<\/li>\n<li>Up to four hours of continuous music<\/li>\n<li>Complimentary online planning forms so our staff can understand your vision<\/li>\n<li>Online music request tools for must-play, play-if-possible, and do-not-play songs<\/li>\n<li>Game idea sheet so you can choose favorite games for your mitzvah celebration<\/li>\n<li>Four-speaker enhanced sound system with subwoofer<\/li>\n<li>Mini-club light show and fog to enhance the party atmosphere<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a Mitzvah Quote<\/a><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h3>Platinum Mitzvah Production Package<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Best for events of 1,000+ guests.<\/strong> The Platinum Package is designed for high-energy mitzvah productions that need a bigger sound system, stronger lighting, dancers, and more visual impact.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Master of Ceremonies to host games, lead dances, and handle introductions<\/li>\n<li>Two truss lighted columns<\/li>\n<li>One VJ \/ DJ to play music and video clips<\/li>\n<li>Two high-energy motivational dancers<\/li>\n<li>Up to four hours of continuous music<\/li>\n<li>Up to six-speaker sound system with JBL PRX powered subwoofer<\/li>\n<li>Intelligent light show and hazer to enhance the party atmosphere<\/li>\n<li>Party favors such as glow necklaces, hats, sunglasses, and similar items<\/li>\n<li>Custom-tailored timeline<\/li>\n<li>Complimentary online planning forms so our staff can understand your vision<\/li>\n<li>Online music request tools for must-play, play-if-possible, and do-not-play songs<\/li>\n<li>Game idea sheet so you can choose favorite games for your mitzvah celebration<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a Mitzvah Quote<\/a><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h3>Platinum Video Mitzvah Package<\/h3>\n<p><strong>Best for large mitzvah celebrations that need video production.<\/strong> This package includes the energy of the Platinum Package with added video support for music videos, montages, and screen-based entertainment.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Everything in the Platinum Package<\/li>\n<li>One VJ \/ DJ to play music and video clips<\/li>\n<li>One 10-foot by 15-foot rear projection video screen<\/li>\n<li>4500 lumen video projector<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myja