cing information.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Photo Booth<\/strong> &#8211; Give guests a fun, interactive way to capture memories. Call for pricing information.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get a Quote Now<\/a><\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\t<h3><strong>Popular Mitzvah Formalities<\/strong><\/h3>\n\t<ul>\n<li>Cocktail Reception<\/li>\n<li>Grand Entrance<\/li>\n<li>Blessings (Ha&#8217;motzi and Kiddush)<\/li>\n<li>Toasts<\/li>\n<li>Dinner<\/li>\n<li>Memory Video<\/li>\n<li>Candle Lighting<\/li>\n<li>Ceremony<\/li>\n<li>Hora (Chair Dance)<\/li>\n<li>Guest of Honor<\/li>\n<li>Dance<\/li>\n<li>Parent Dances<\/li>\n<li>Last Dance<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\t<h3><strong>Mitzvah Games<\/strong><\/h3>\n\t<ul>\n<li>Coke and Pepsi<\/li>\n<li>Game Show Mania<\/li>\n<li>Scavenger Hunt<\/li>\n<li>Musical Chairs<\/li>\n<li>Stuff-It (T-Shirt Balloon Stuff)<\/li>\n<li>Hula Hoop Pass<\/li>\n<li>Limbo Contest<\/li>\n<li>Balloon Stomp<\/li>\n<li>Mummy Wrap<\/li>\n<li>Freeze Dance<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\t<h3><strong>Mitzvah Dance<\/strong><\/h3>\n\t<ul>\n<li>Cupid Shuffle<\/li>\n<li>Cha Cha Slide<\/li>\n<li>Cotton Eye Joe<\/li>\n<li>Electric Slide<\/li>\n<li>Snowball Dance<\/li>\n<li>Thriller<\/li>\n<li>Hora<\/li>\n<li>Macarena<\/li>\n<li>Tonto &#8220;Jump On It&#8221;<\/li>\n<li>The Train<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>And Many More<\/strong><\/p>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Atlanta Bar Mitzvah DJ &amp; Bat Mitzvah Entertainment Packages JAMMIN&#8217; DJs provides Atlanta Bar Mitzvah DJ and Bat Mitzvah entertainment packages designed to keep kids engaged, adults included, and the celebration moving. Our mitzvah team can help with music, games, MC services, motivational dancers, lighting, video, party flow, and custom entertainment options for your family&#8217;s&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":5403,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"